OL,3,AKenya minister warns foreigners against
OL,4,A'misusing' visas to trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is unclear how many foreign
OL,7,Fnationals are involved in small-scale
OL,8,Ftrading or how many would be affected
OL,9,Fby the crackdown.
